<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="top">Subject to any early termination as may be determined by the Board or its delegate(s) pursuant to the 2025 Share Incentive Scheme, the 2025 Share Incentive Scheme shall be valid and effective for a period of 10 (ten) years
