<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="top">To the best knowledge of the Directors, no financial assistance has been provided by the Group to the Grantees for the purchase of Shares under the 2025 Share Incentive Scheme.</TD></TR>
</TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The new Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares to be issued and allotted by the Company to the Grantees under the RSU Grants represent
